Classify a single PNG image using a trained network

<BIN> predict [OPTIONS]

OPTIONS:
  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit
          --network TEXT:FILE REQUIRED 
                              Trained network file (.wgt) to load
          --image TEXT:FILE REQUIRED 
                              PNG image to classify

Dataset:
          --dataset-img-width UINT [28]  
                              Width of test images in pixels.
          --dataset-img-height UINT [28]  
                              Height of test images in pixels.
